    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you afraid of heights?</strong><br>Now is the perfect time to face that fear and overcome it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boom Buddy</strong> is a fast-paced arcade game where your goal is to save a boy who's falling straight into the hands of dangerous enemies. His only chance of survival? Two connected suction cups that help him stick to the walls and slow his descent. Time your moves precisely, react quickly, and grab onto the walls before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fall won't be easy. You'll face a series of tricky traps and unpredictable obstacles that can throw you off course. If you react fast and anticipate the dangers, you\u2019ll find a way through. It\u2019s just like using a parachute\u2014open it at the right time and you live. Miss your moment, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level, the challenge increases, testing your reflexes, timing, and focus. Will you be able to guide the boy to safety?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unique and increasingly difficult levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of falling traps and hazards to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different character skins to unlock and play with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and fast-paced gameplay for quick fun sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A test of reflexes, timing, and decision-making under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold on tight\u2014Boom Buddy is about to drop you into the action!</strong></p>",
